# Local sandbox holding a copy of the `dashboard-restructure` branch's
# Dashboard/, used to run and test it. Deliberately untracked: that code lives
# on its own branch and is deployed as its own service, so a copy on main would
# be a third version to keep in step — and edits here would never reach the
# live dashboard.
dashboard/
